3. Implementing a custom retry policy with Resilience4j:
```java
import io.github.resilience4j.retry.Retry;
import io.github.resilience4j.retry.RetryConfig;

public class RetryPolicy {
    private static final String RETRY_INSTANCE = "retryInstance";

    public void setup() {
        RetryConfig config = RetryConfig.custom().maxAttempts(3).waitDuration(Duration.ofMillis(100)).build();
        RetryRegistry registry = RetryRegistry.of(config);
        Retry retryInstance = registry.retry(RETRY_INSTANCE);
    }
}
```
4. Metrics and logging with Micrometer and Logback:
```java
import io.micrometer.core.instrument.MeterRegistry;
import org.slf4j.Logger;
import org.slf4j.LoggerFactory;

@Service
public class MicroservicesService {
    private static final Logger LOGGER = LoggerFactory.getLogger(MicroservicesService.class);
